rf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, August to September ran 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, and July to August ran 59%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 182% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21445 had its driest year in 1980 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
